    "noteTitle": "PI Motor Accident - Letter of Claim",
    "noteText": "# PI Motor Accident - Letter of Claim\n\n## Use when\n- Opponent or insurer identified.\n- Pre-action settlement demand.\n- Liability facts sufficiently known.\n\n## Do not use when\n- Proceedings already commenced.\n- Defendant identity unknown.\n- Medical position too uncertain for quantum demand.\n\n## Clauses\n### CCTV preservation\nUse early where incident location has likely CCTV. Do not use if stale unless lawyer wants preservation request anyway. [VERIFY]\n\n### Special damages\nUse only when receipts/pay slips/medical bills are available; otherwise insert placeholder and evidence task.",
